  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lucifer Greetings - DialogueLine 14
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: ' Any tip on how I close that portal the demons are coming from?'
    portugueseLine: "Alguma dica de como eu fecho esse portal que os dem\xF4nios
      est\xE3o vindo? "
    chineseLine: "\u6709\u4EC0\u4E48\u529E\u6CD5\u5173\u95ED\u90A3\u4E2A\u6076\u9B54\u51FA\u73B0\u7684\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u5417?  "
    spanishLine: " \xBFAlg\xFAn consejo para cerrar ese portal del que vienen los
      demonios?"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " Impossible. Lucifer\u2019s fall created a fissure so deep in the
      earth that it reached Hell. A place of elemental fury where Lucifer made his
      home. In the first Celestial War, angels tried to seal the fissure. "
    portugueseLine: "Imposs\xEDvel. A queda de l\xFAcifer criou uma fenda t\xE3o
      profunda na terra que chegou at\xE9 o Inferno. Um lugar de f\xFAria elemental
      onde L\xFAcifer fez sua morada. Na primeira Guerra Celestial, os anjos tentaram
      tapar a fenda. "
    chineseLine: "\u4E0D\u53EF\u80FD\u3002\u8DEF\u897F\u6CD5\u5760\u843D\u9020\u6210\u5730\u5E95\u6DF1\u9677\uFF0C\u4E00\u76F4\u901A\u5230\u5730\u72F1\u3002\u5143\u7D20\u6124\u6012\u4E4B\u5730\uFF0C\u8DEF\u897F\u6CD5\u5728\u90A3\u91CC\u5B89\u5BB6\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Imposible. La ca\xEDda de Lucifer cre\xF3 una fisura tan profunda
      en la tierra que lleg\xF3 hasta el Infierno. Un lugar de furia elemental donde
      Lucifer hizo su morada. En la primera Guerra Celestial, los \xE1ngeles intentaron
      tapar la fisura. "
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: Many died and it turned into a river of blood. Nowadays that river
      is called Styx.
    portugueseLine: Muitos morreram e a fenda se tornou um rio de sangue. Hoje em
      dia chama-se esse rio de Estige.
    chineseLine: "\u5728\u7B2C\u4E00\u6B21\u5929\u6218\u65F6\uFF0C\u5929\u4F7F\u8BD5\u56FE\u5C01\u95ED\u88C2\u9699\uFF0C\u5F88\u591A\u5929\u4F7F\u727A\u7272\uFF0C\u88C2\u9699\u6210\u4E86\u4E00\u6761\u8840\u6CB3\u3002\u5982\u4ECA\u90A3\u6CB3\u53EB\u505A\u51A5\u6CB3\uFF08Styx\uFF09\u3002"
    spanishLine: "Muchos murieron y la fisura se convirti\xF3 en un r\xEDo de sangre.
      Hoy en d\xEDa ese r\xEDo se llama Estigia."
